<title>USA: Furman University, S.C., yields 5.75 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>Furman University, S.C., yields 5.75 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Wednesday it tentatively priced $23.5 million South Carolina Educational Facilities Authority bonds, for Furman University, at a top yield of 5.75 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>SOUTH CAROLINA EDUCATIONAL FACILITIES</p>
