<p>HIGHER LEARNING EDUCATIONAL FACILITIES REVENUE</p>
<p>BONDS (FURMAN UNIVERSITY PROJECT)</p>
<p>RE: $23,480,000*</p>
<p>SERIES 1996A BONDS (FIXED RATE)</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES OF DTC</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa (MBIA INS)    S&amp;P: NA	 FITCH: AAA (MBIA INS)</p>
<p>	   UNDERLYING: A     UNDERLYING: A+</p>
<p>DATED: 10/15/1996	    FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
